# Lessons service

The lessons document and export helpers are `Tsugi\Services\Lessons`, one class per file:

- `LessonsService` — loaded document (lookup, progress math, URL expansion)
- `LessonsNormalize` — item shape
- `LessonsCartridge` — Settings cartridge zip (not `Services\Cartridge` import)
- `LessonsLegacyFiles` / `LessonsLegacyGift` — file-based `/cc` export only

Do not merge those classes. Do not move them back under `Tsugi\UI`. Do not put page HTML in this namespace.

`Tsugi\UI\Lessons` is an empty subclass of `LessonsService` so tools outside this repo can keep `new \Tsugi\UI\Lessons($CFG->lessons)`. Leave that file in place.

Page HTML stays in the controllers: `Controllers\Lessons` (shell, `renderItem`, progress badges), assignments, badges, labs, and `Controllers\Discussions::renderDiscussions`. `cc/index.php` and `cc/export.php` keep their forms. The shared select and preview markup is `cc/legacy_form.php`.

`Tsugi\Services\Cartridge` is Settings import. `GiftImporter` / `Qti12Exporter` / `Quiz1Repository` stay in `Tsugi\Services\Quiz1`. File-based `$CFG->lessons` stays classic.
